---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Warhammer 40k Beginner's Guide" description="New to Warhammer 40k? Find your army, learn to build and paint models, and start playing. The guide that actually helps.">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="px-6 pt-20 pb-16 text-center">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <p class="text-[#c9a84c] text-sm font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-4 font-display">
        Warhammer 40,000 — Beginner's Guide
      </p>
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold leading-tight mb-6">
        You're interested.<br />
        <span class="text-[#c9a84c]">Now what?</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-[#8a8590] text-lg sm:text-xl leading-relaxed mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Warhammer 40k is incredible — and genuinely hard to get into. The official materials don't help much. This guide does. We'll take you from curious to confidently playing, step by step.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/quiz"
        class="inline-block bg-[#c9a84c] hover:bg-[#dfc070] text-[#111113] font-semibold px-8 py-4 rounded text-lg transition-colors font-display tracking-wide"
      >
        Find Your Army →
      </a>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-[#4a4855]">Takes about 2 minutes. No sign-up required.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Divider -->
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="border-t border-[#2a2a35]"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- What is 40k -->
  <section class="px-6 py-16">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-[#c9a84c] mb-6">What even is this?</h2>
      <div class="text-[#b8b4c0] leading-relaxed space-y-4 text-lg">
        <p>
          Warhammer 40,000 is a tabletop miniature war game set in a dark sci-fi universe 38,000 years in the future. You build an army of plastic (or resin) miniatures, paint them, and battle against other players on a tabletop battlefield.
        </p>
        <p>
          But honestly? A lot of people get into it mostly for the hobby — collecting, building, and painting the models. The game itself is the payoff after all that work. Both things are real, and both are worth it.
        </p>
        <p>
          The catch: the barrier to entry is steep. There are dozens of factions, hundreds of unit types, layers of rules, and a genuine learning curve to painting. Most resources assume you already know someone who plays. This guide assumes you don't.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Journey Steps -->
  <section class="px-6 py-16 bg-[#0d0d0f]">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-center mb-2">The path in</h2>
      <p class="text-center text-[#8a8590] mb-12">Every guide on this site covers one of these steps.</p>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">

        <a href="/quiz" class="block bg-[#1a1a1f] border border-[#2a2a35] hover:border-[#c9a84c] rounded-lg p-6 transition-colors group">
          <div class="text-2xl mb-3">🎯</div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-lg mb-2 group-hover:text-[#c9a84c] transition-colors">Find Your Army</h3>
          <p class="text-[#8a8590] text-sm leading-relaxed">The biggest decision — and the one that costs real money if you get it wrong. Take the quiz and we'll match you to a faction that fits how you want to play and paint.</p>
        </a>

        <a href="/factions" class="block bg-[#1a1a1f] border border-[#2a2a35] hover:border-[#c9a84c] rounded-lg p-6 transition-colors group">
          <div class="text-2xl mb-3">📖</div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-lg mb-2 group-hover:text-[#c9a84c] transition-colors">Know Your Faction</h3>
          <p class="text-[#8a8590] text-sm leading-relaxed">Deep dives on every major faction — lore, playstyle, how hard they are to paint, what to buy first, and honest cost estimates.</p>
        </a>

        <a href="/building" class="block bg-[#1a1a1f] border border-[#2a2a35] hover:border-[#c9a84c] rounded-lg p-6 transition-colors group">
          <div class="text-2xl mb-3">🔧</div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-lg mb-2 group-hover:text-[#c9a84c] transition-colors">Build Your Models</h3>
          <p class="text-[#8a8590] text-sm leading-relaxed">How to cut, trim, and assemble without destroying your models — including how to actually read GW's notoriously confusing instructions.</p>
        </a>

        <a href="/painting" class="block bg-[#1a1a1f] border border-[#2a2a35] hover:border-[#c9a84c] rounded-lg p-6 transition-colors group">
          <div class="text-2xl mb-3">🎨</div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-lg mb-2 group-hover:text-[#c9a84c] transition-colors">Paint Your Army</h3>
          <p class="text-[#8a8590] text-sm leading-relaxed">What paints and tools you actually need. The slapchop technique for getting an army done fast. Step by step, no art degree required.</p>
        </a>

        <a href="/basing" class="block bg-[#1a1a1f] border border-[#2a2a35] hover:border-[#c9a84c] rounded-lg p-6 transition-colors group">
          <div class="text-2xl mb-3">🏔️</div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-lg mb-2 group-hover:text-[#c9a84c] transition-colors">Base Your Models</h3>
          <p class="text-[#8a8590] text-sm leading-relaxed">The step most guides skip. A good base turns a painted miniature into a scene. Texture paints, tufts, static grass — easier than it looks.</p>
        </a>

        <a href="/getting-started" class="block bg-[#1a1a1f] border border-[#2a2a35] hover:border-[#c9a84c] rounded-lg p-6 transition-colors group">
          <div class="text-2xl mb-3">⚔️</div>
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-lg mb-2 group-hover:text-[#c9a84c] transition-colors">Play the Game</h3>
          <p class="text-[#8a8590] text-sm leading-relaxed">How a game of 40k actually works. Turns, objectives, dice, what your first game looks like — without drowning you in the full rulebook.</p>
        </a>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Quiz CTA -->
  <section class="px-6 py-20 text-center">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Not sure where to start?</h2>
      <p class="text-[#8a8590] text-lg mb-8">The army quiz is the best first move. Answer 5 questions, get a faction recommendation with reasoning. Takes 2 minutes.</p>
      <a
        href="/quiz"
        class="inline-block bg-[#c9a84c] hover:bg-[#dfc070] text-[#111113] font-semibold px-8 py-4 rounded text-lg transition-colors font-display tracking-wide"
      >
        Take the Army Quiz →
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
